<title>HONG KONG: Trade in Lam Soon (HK) shrs suspended.</title>
<headline>Trade in Lam Soon (HK) shrs suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of food processing and electronics trading group Lam Soon (Hong Kong) Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>The company's shares rose HK$0.05 to HK$1.29 on Monday.</p>
<p>Lam Soon (Hong Kong) on Monday reported a net loss of HK$82.29 million for the year ended in December 1996, compared with a HK$62.69 million loss the year before.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
